    "created_at": "2016-06-02T02:09:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-02T02:09:08Z",
    "body": "I think that is unrelated to fullscreen at all. Firefox seems to always allow the content overriding those keyboard shortcuts via `preventDefault()`, no matter whether it is in fullscreen or not.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
